{"4662090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyberpix '89", "steam_appid": 4662090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyberPix ’89 is a music-driven arcade shooter where sound isn’t just background, it’s the system. Every track you play directly influences gameplay, from enemy spawns to movement speed and intensity. Whether you stick with the built-in soundtrack or upload your own music, each session becomes a unique, reactive experience.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/6e2a2b4c076a0d01348353ec08d046dc.avif?t=1779931140\" width=1164 height=1129 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight through a retro-futuristic 1989 in this fast-paced cyberpunk action game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/ee00ce8b50fc650b9722cd5418c42d13.poster.avif?t=1779931140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/ee00ce8b50fc650b9722cd5418c42d13.webm?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/ee00ce8b50fc650b9722cd5418c42d13.mp4?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade your weapons, level up your abilities, and become unstoppable.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/15f877f04f8925e9d4708ed2c5eb01b5.poster.avif?t=1779931140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/15f877f04f8925e9d4708ed2c5eb01b5.webm?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/15f877f04f8925e9d4708ed2c5eb01b5.mp4?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hunt down enemies and put every boss in the ground.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/36341f446bf9d9a9b0cefa6d8da4a2cc.poster.avif?t=1779931140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/36341f446bf9d9a9b0cefa6d8da4a2cc.webm?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/36341f446bf9d9a9b0cefa6d8da4a2cc.mp4?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music-Reactive Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy spawns, movement, speed, and intensity all sync dynamically with the music</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Your Own Music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and play with your personal library for a fully customized experience (local use with restrictions)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Difficulty System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game speed and chaos scale based on BPM, energy, and song structure. Beat &amp; Intensity Detection that reacts to drops, bridges, and transitions... not just raw tempo</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic arcade shooters with a modern, audio-driven twist</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs feel the same thanks to ever-changing music input</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on both precision shooting and rhythm awareness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CyberPix ’89 isn’t just about surviving waves... it’s about syncing with them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyberPix ’89 is a music-driven arcade shooter where sound isn’t just background, it’s the system. Every track you play directly influences gameplay, from enemy spawns to movement speed and intensity. Whether you stick with the built-in soundtrack or upload your own music, each session becomes a unique, reactive experience.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/6e2a2b4c076a0d01348353ec08d046dc.avif?t=1779931140\" width=1164 height=1129 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight through a retro-futuristic 1989 in this fast-paced cyberpunk action game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/ee00ce8b50fc650b9722cd5418c42d13.poster.avif?t=1779931140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/ee00ce8b50fc650b9722cd5418c42d13.webm?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/extras/ee00ce8b50fc650b9722cd5418c42d13.mp4?t=1779931140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></