 (local use with restrictions)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Difficulty System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game speed and chaos scale based on BPM, energy, and song structure. Beat &amp; Intensity Detection that reacts to drops, bridges, and transitions... not just raw tempo</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic arcade shooters with a modern, audio-driven twist</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs feel the same thanks to ever-changing music input</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on both precision shooting and rhythm awareness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CyberPix ’89 isn’t just about surviving waves... it’s about syncing with them.</p>", "short_description": "Enter a retro-futuristic, music-reactive arcade shooter where every beat shapes the chaos. Adapt, survive, and sync with the rhythm as you fight your way through the underworld.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, French, Korean, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Italian, Polish, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/4dbb12117bcd7f08e19078573e705c50f8572737/header.jpg?t=1779931140", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/9d45ac28ad029eb78e89ceb6fc9b6e62c61c2707/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779931140", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662090/9d45ac28ad029eb78e89ceb6fc9b6e62c61c2707/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779931140", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br>